  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "46815845",
      "title": "Bubble Sort",
      "lectureOrder": 214,
      "videoOrder": 212,
      "sourceHash": "b7dd4c7dc369c4b55b12ba1ce68c6689619aaf3fa64452e6fe56c0b62393a461",
      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 5.24,
          "end": 5.75,
          "en": "All right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.75,
          "end": 8.3,
          "en": "In this lecture we are going to learn about bubble sort.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.33,
          "end": 14.66,
          "en": "Bubble sort is a simple way of sorting the steps for sorting for any given data in case of bubble sort",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.69,
          "end": 15.65,
          "en": "is very easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.86,
          "end": 22.31,
          "en": "Basically, we repeatedly compare each pair of adjacent items and swap them if they are in the wrong",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.31,
          "end": 22.76,
          "en": "order.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.76,
          "end": 26.24,
          "en": "We repeat this process until all elements get sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.27,
          "end": 28.28,
          "en": "So let's say we have an example like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.28,
          "end": 32.33,
          "en": "So in case of bubble sort, first we are going to start from the left side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.33,
          "end": 34.7,
          "en": "And we are going to compare these two elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.7,
          "end": 39.98,
          "en": "So if the left element is greater than the right one we are just going to swap them and we are going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.98,
          "end": 41.84,
          "en": "to continue to the next pair.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.84,
          "end": 44.48,
          "en": "So in the next pair we have five and one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.48,
          "end": 49.28,
          "en": "So five is greater than one which means that left element is greater than right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.28,
          "end": 50.66,
          "en": "We are just going to swap them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.66,
          "end": 53.33,
          "en": "And one more time we are going to continue to the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.33,
          "end": 55.46,
          "en": "And we are going to compare these pairs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.46,
          "end": 57.05,
          "en": "So five is greater than two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.08,
          "end": 61.76,
          "en": "So this means that we are just going to swap them and it will continue to the right one more time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.76,
          "end": 64.73,
          "en": "So here again five is greater than four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 64.76,
          "end": 66.44,
          "en": "We are just going to swap them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.44,
          "end": 69.14,
          "en": "And we will continue one step right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.14,
          "end": 71.75,
          "en": "And we are going to compare five with seven.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.75,
          "end": 73.58,
          "en": "So five is less than seven.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.58,
          "end": 76.49,
          "en": "This means that left element is less than the right one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.49,
          "end": 80.69,
          "en": "We are not going to swap them and we will continue to do one step right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.69,
          "end": 84.35,
          "en": "So here the left element is seven which is greater than six.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.35,
          "end": 85.64,
          "en": "We are just going to swap them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.64,
          "end": 88.31,
          "en": "And we are going to consider seven as sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.31,
          "end": 94.4,
          "en": "Because when we reach the right end of the this sequence in one round of operation, the biggest value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.4,
          "end": 96.95,
          "en": "in the sequence will move to the right edge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.95,
          "end": 100.07,
          "en": "And this is going to be considered as fully sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.07,
          "end": 102.02000000000001,
          "en": "So this element is fully sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.02000000000001,
          "end": 105.35,
          "en": "So this means that we are going to start the operation from the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.35,
          "end": 108.08,
          "en": "So here again we are going to compare these two pairs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.08,
          "end": 110.36,
          "en": "So three is greater than one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 110.39,
          "end": 111.59,
          "en": "We are just going to swap it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.59,
          "end": 114.38,
          "en": "And one more time we are going to continue to the next pair.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.38,
          "end": 116.21000000000001,
          "en": "So three is greater than two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.24000000000001,
          "end": 119.6,
          "en": "We are just going to swap it and we will continue to the next pair.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.6,
          "end": 121.88,
          "en": "We see that three is less than four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.91,
          "end": 123.26,
          "en": "We are not going to swap them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.26,
          "end": 125,
          "en": "And here again four is less than five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 125.03,
          "end": 126.17,
          "en": "We are not going to swap them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.17,
          "end": 131.84,
          "en": "And we have reached the end of the this sequence because we have considered these seven as a sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 131.84,
          "end": 134.63,
          "en": "We are not going to continue to do this pair anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 134.63,
          "end": 136.79,
          "en": "So the last element in this case is six.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 136.79,
          "end": 139.1,
          "en": "So six will be considered as sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 139.1,
          "end": 141.47,
          "en": "So one more time we are going to start from the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 141.47,
          "end": 144.23,
          "en": "So it's obvious that in the beginning we have one and two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 144.26,
          "end": 145.49,
          "en": "We are not going to swap them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.49,
          "end": 146.9,
          "en": "So then we have two and three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.93,
          "end": 149.99,
          "en": "We are not going to swap them because two is less than three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 149.99,
          "end": 152.24,
          "en": "And here again three is less than four.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.27,
          "end": 153.48,
          "en": "We are not swapping them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.48,
          "end": 157.35,
          "en": "And when we reach the last pair here again, four is less than five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 161.13,
          "en": "We are not swapping them, we are just going to consider five as sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.13,
          "end": 164.16,
          "en": "So this operation will continue again from the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 164.16,
          "end": 166.86,
          "en": "So here again we are comparing these two pairs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 166.86,
          "end": 170.19,
          "en": "We are not swapping them and we are comparing these two pairs as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 170.19,
          "end": 173.25,
          "en": "We are not swapping them because two is less than three.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 174.96,
          "en": "And we will continue to the next pair.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 174.96,
          "end": 176.16,
          "en": "And this is the last pair.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 176.16,
          "end": 178.8,
          "en": "We are going to consider the four as sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 181.26,
          "en": "So it will continue one more time from the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 181.26,
          "end": 184.65,
          "en": "So we are going to consider the three as sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 184.68,
          "end": 189.21,
          "en": "Then when we reach over here we are going to consider one and two as sorted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 189.21,
          "end": 194.85,
          "en": "So as you can see, every time we are just going to compare two pairs and check that if the left one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.85,
          "end": 197.19,
          "en": "is greater than the right one, we are just going to swap it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 202.41,
          "en": "If it is not, we are just going to continue to the next pairs until we finished all of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 202.41,
          "end": 205.92000000000002,
          "en": "So that's how the logic behind the bubble sorts work.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
